        <mxCell id="node_sys_post_update" value="1. Deduct on-hand stock (FIFO)&#xa;2. Fulfill stock reservation&#xa;3. Activate electronic warranty&#xa;4. Change SO status to &quot;POSTED&quot;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=10.5;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
